0 -14 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  "Luira phanitli luisak kashung, iram Hunphunli kapha kachon.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  "Awungana shimlut-kaphung sara, luishang kachivali mashak khare.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
