0 -14 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  "At the arrival of Luira festival, the seed-sowing season commences in) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  Hunphun.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  "The village chief performs the sacred sod-turning ritual before any) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  villager may plant.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  "Through festival dances, athletic wrestling, and prayers, the community) Tj
0 -13 Td
